en:
{0E}"Master said something really complicated about it, but{0F}
the bearded look was just so cute that I happily took it!"{w}{p}"My master is Master Shimerief.{w}You'll find Master up in the watchtower
in Roscadil every night."{w}

"Deee-cooy-kiiins! Where are youuu?{w}Geez, after I went to all the trouble of saving y... Oh, hello.
Have you seen Decoykins?"{w}{p}"A drunk was picking on Decoykins, so I gave
the drunk a good thrashing, and as thanks I'd lick... ahem.{w}I was just hoping to be allowed a little touch, you know?"{w}

"And that's where you all come in!{w}The goblins are sure to have something good,
so please go and get it from them at Ogre Bay!"{w}{p}"I'm going to try catching Decoykins
all on my own!{w}I'm counting on you!"{w}

"I've been waiting for this!
Thank you so much!!"{w}{p}"And the mechanism's nice and sturdy... The goblins really know their stuff!
Alll right, Decoykins... Guheh~"{w}

"Who're you guys? Haven't seen your faces around.
Whatcha doing? Oh, I got it! You guys are those,
ad-ven-churers! Right? I'm right, aren't I?"{w}

"Okay, now you guess who I am! Go on!
Aww, ya can't, huh? Fine, I'll tell ya!
I'm Decoy! Got it? Yeah, ya got it!"{w}

"Yo, you guys! What's up today?
Oh! Whatcha holding there?
What is it? What is it?"{w}

"Hey, your heads change shape, right?
Do they ever shrink?
Huh? They don't shrink? Liar!"{w}{p}"I know your hair gets shorter!"{w}

"Hey, lemme up on your shoulder!
And don't go saying I'm cute or like a doll!
I'm taking a bit of the stuff on your head!"{w}

"...What, it grows back, right?
The stuff on your face is fine too, y'know.
I'm gonna yank it out! Hup!"{w}

{0E}"Ow! Hey, don't drop me!
...Huh? ...Did it hurt that bad?{0F}
...............Sorry."{w}{p}"I heard Beard Girl's comes off,
so I figured yours did too..."{w}

{0E}"...Sorry, okay? Are you mad?
...You're not mad?{0F}
Okay, then we're good! So gimme that thing!"{w}

"Ahh... but thanks anyway, you guys.
If I think up another good plan, I'm counting on ya!"{w}{p}"Oh yeah, here's your reward!
I don't need it, so keep it!"{w}

{0E}"Never mind the goods. But...{0F}
the copy of Mujirod's writings I had sought for many years{w}was stolen by ruffians, along with the rest."{w}{p}"It is filled with words that cannot be replaced.{w}I thought my attachment to things
had faded away long ago, but"{w}{p}"that one, it seems, is the exception."{w}

"Here at the temple, besides putting light into Fame,
we can also tell you about the myths,
or give you an oracle."{w}{p}"Feel free to ask me about anything."{w}

{0E}"Seeing karma is what a fortune-teller does,
but we can read other people's, never our own.{0F}
If we could, I'd be raking it in by now..."{w}

{0E}"Guess you really can't cheat after all...
My luck was supposed to be at its very best... and yet...?{0F}
...Oh!"{w}
